\f7  (
\f0 \uc0\u55349 \u56339 \u55349 \u56346 \u55349 \u56356 \u55349 \u56346 \u55349 \u56354 \u55349 \u56364 \u55349 \u56354 \u55349 \u56359 \u55349 \u56356 \u55349 \u56370 \u55349 \u56365 \u55349 \u56356 \u55349 \u56350 \u55349 \u56359 \u55349 \u56365 \u55349 \u56346 \u776 
\f7 ):
\f1\b0  Suljettu s\'e4\'e4t\'f6piiri, joka tarkkailee moottorin todellista k\'e4yt\'f6st\'e4 (vastetta) ja korjaa synteesi\'e4 v\'e4litt\'f6m\'e4sti.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f7\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f9 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\uc0\u7533 
